      "id": "claim-teotihuacan-decline-hypothesis",
      "kind": "hypothesis",
      "statement": {
        "zh": "假说：6–7 世纪衰落的因果（内乱、气候、外敌）仍高度争议，需与地层烧毁/废弃证据分开（Cowgill 讨论语境）。",
        "en": "Hypothesis: 6th–7th c. decline causes (internal conflict, climate, external enemies) remain debated and must be separated from stratified burn/abandonment evidence (Cowgill discussion context)."
      },
